{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["הן היום הקריבו את חטאתם ואת עולתם — it is the olah and the ḥattat of Aharon and his sons written above: קח לך עגל בן בקר לחטאת ואיל לעולה תמימים — and the sons assisted Aharon in receiving the blood, as stated above. And thus Aharon said: Why are you angry with my sons?! Have not I and my sons today offered our offerings, with which we were inaugurated into the service, and in the midst of this greatness a great calamity has come upon us?!" "ותקראנה אותי כאלה — and how could I eat a ḥattat of kodshei kodashim on this day, when our joy has been spoiled and confounded?! Like a humiliated bride who committed adultery in the midst of her wedding canopy."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:35.856756554Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}